  "source_note": "ROKAE rokae_description 0.0.5 in a public third-party mirror, not the official manufacturer repository. Its package.xml explicitly declares Apache License 2.0. All 16 AR5-08 meshes are byte-identical to the benchmark meshes. This establishes geometry correspondence, not equivalence of the different model suffixes or dynamics.",
  "changes": [
    "Preserved benchmark model/link/joint names, resource paths, wrist flange/camera assembly, collision integration and all prior native/rendering bytes.",
    "Benchmark URDFs differ from the public reference in masses, inertia tensors and centers of mass for links 1-7; effort limits are 113/70 rather than 108/66 for joints 1-4; joint 6/7 ranges are +/-1.0472 rather than +/-0.8727 rad; left velocity literals use rounded values. These are retained benchmark configuration values, not certified manufacturer specifications.",
    "Standalone exports rewrite mesh locations only. Runtime USD layers are HandsOn conversions/material adaptations of the corresponding geometry; camera and flange additions are HandsOn-authored.",
    "Full compared parameter values and upstream reference files are retained alongside SOURCE.json. No physics, reset, controller or render asset is replaced by the public reference."
  ],
